To do the modelsim simulation and compilation of the trickbox and tbench, type
"make TBENCH=<tbench_number> rtl"

Eg.:
   1.To run the simulation using tbench7 type
     make TBENCH=7 rtl
   
   2. To run the simulation using tbench type
      make TBENCH= rtl

